cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this proof, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "The 2-Domination Number and the Upper Median Degree: A Proof of Graffiti.pc Conjecture 387"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "JunQing"
date-released: 2026-07-24
abstract: >-
  A proof that the 2-domination number of every nonempty finite simple graph G
  of order n satisfies gamma_2(G) <= n - m(G) + 1, where m(G) is the upper
  median of its degree sequence.
keywords:
  - 2-domination
  - domination number
  - degree sequence
  - upper median degree
  - Graffiti.pc
